<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-PT">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Obras · Winterplateau</title>
<meta name="description" content="Portefólio de obras Winterplateau — reabilitação de fachadas e construção nova com molduras em EPS. Veja o antes e o depois de cada projeto.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/winter.css">
<style is:global>
.ob-hero{background:#000;padding:calc(62px + clamp(60px,9vw,110px)) var(--g) clamp(54px,7vw,88px);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.ob-hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.5;background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(25,163,224,.16) .6px,transparent .6px);background-size:24px 24px;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#000,transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#000,transparent)}
.ob-hero-in{max-width:var(--mw);margin:0 auto;position:relative}
.ob-eye{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.32);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:18px}
.ob-eye::before{content:'';width:22px;height:1px;background:var(--bl)}
.ob-h{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(48px,8vw,108px);line-height:.92;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:22px}
.ob-h em{font-style:italic;color:var(--bl)}
.ob-sub{font-size:clamp(14px,1.2vw,16px);font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,255,255,.46);line-height:1.8;max-width:560px}
.ob-body{padding:clamp(48px,6vw,80px) var(--g) var(--sv);background:var(--off)}
.ob-tools{max-width:var(--mw);margin:0 auto 30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ob-filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.fbtn{padding:12px 19px;border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:#fff;border-radius:30px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2);transition:all .15s}
.fbtn:hover{border-color:var(--bl);color:var(--bl)}
.fbtn.on{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}
.ob-count{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:.02em}
.ob-count b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
.pcard{animation:fadeUp .5s ease both}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
/* CTA */
.ob-cta{background:var(--bl);padding:clamp(72px,9vw,118px) var(--g);text-align:center}
.ob-cta h2{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,64px);color:#fff;line-height:1.04;margin-bottom:12px}
.ob-cta p{font-size:14px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,255,255,.62);margin-bottom:28px}
.ob-cta .btn-w{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 26px;background:#fff;color:var(--bld);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em;border-radius:3px;transition:transform .15s}
.ob-cta .btn-w:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
@media(max-width:640px){.ob-tools{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="chrome"></div>

<header class="ob-hero">
  <div class="ob-hero-grid"></div>
  <div class="ob-hero-in">
    <div class="ob-eye">Portefólio</div>
    <h1 class="ob-h">As nossas <em>obras</em></h1>
    <p class="ob-sub">Reabilitação de fachadas e construção nova por todo o norte de Portugal. Em cada projeto, arraste a comparação para ver a transformação que as molduras e o isolamento Winterplateau trazem ao edifício.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="ob-body">
  <div class="ob-tools">
    <div class="ob-filters" id="filters">
      <button class="fbtn on" data-f="all">Todas</button>
      <button class="fbtn" data-f="Reabilitação">Reabilitação</button>
      <button class="fbtn" data-f="Construção Nova">Construção Nova</button>
    </div>
    <div class="ob-count" id="count"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="obras-grid" id="obrasGrid"></div>
</section>

<section class="ob-cta">
  <h2>Tem um projeto em mente?</h2>
  <p>Fale com a nossa equipa técnica e descubra a solução certa para a sua obra.</p>
  <a href="index.html#contact" class="btn-w">Solicitar Orçamento
    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
  </a>
</section>

<div id="footerSlot"></div>

<script is:inline src="/assets/projects.js"></script>
<script is:inline>
// chrome
document.getElementById('chrome').innerHTML = navHTML('obras');
document.getElementById('footerSlot').innerHTML = footerHTML();
initChrome();

// grid + filtering
const grid = document.getElementById('obrasGrid');
const count = document.getElementById('count');
function render(filter){
  const list = filter === 'all' ? PROJECTS : PROJECTS.filter(p => p.type === filter);
  grid.innerHTML = list.map(p => cardHTML(p, false)).join('');
  count.innerHTML = '<b>' + list.length + '</b> obra' + (list.length === 1 ? '' : 's');
}
document.querySelectorAll('#filters .fbtn').forEach(b => {
  b.addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.querySelectorAll('#filters .fbtn').forEach(x => x.classList.remove('on'));
    b.classList.add('on');
    render(b.dataset.f);
  });
});
render('all');
</script>
</body>
</html>
